{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05352","headline":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴 · 源乾曜","name":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"盛业光书府，徵人尽国英。\n丝纶贤得相，羣俊学爲名。\n宠命垂天锡，崇恩发睿情。\n熏风清禁籞，文殿述皇明。\n日霁庭阴出，池曛水气生。\n欢娱此无限，诗酒自相迎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"源乾曜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}